Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 16:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] pal: Follow the screen rotation on the FourSemi speaker

The four channel FourSemi speaker on piano picks which speakers play
left and right in the DSP, from the screen rotation. Stock PAL sends the
raw rotation, 0 to 3, as tag 0x0C00003B key 0x00270000 on low latency,
deep buffer, offload and spatial streams. Do the same instead of the
stereo MFC swap, which only covers two channel speakers.
---
 resource_manager/src/ResourceManager.cpp |  5 +++-
 session/src/Session.cpp                  | 37 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 41 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/resource_manager/src/ResourceManager.cpp b/resource_manager/src/ResourceManager.cpp
index 7b6dbea..e0fcaa5 100644
--- a/resource_manager/src/ResourceManager.cpp
+++ b/resource_manager/src/ResourceManager.cpp
